---
title: Pornstar Martini
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 26 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @vanilla vodka{1.5%fl_oz}, @passion fruit liqueur{0.5%fl_oz}, @passion fruit purée{1%fl_oz}, @lime juice{0.5%fl_oz} and @vanilla syrup{0.5%fl_oz}. Shake hard for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Float half a @passion fruit{0.5} on top, and serve a shot glass of @prosecco{2%fl_oz} alongside.

> Created by Douglas Ankrah in London, around 2002.
